  "stages": [
    {
      "anchor": [
        0.0,
        2.65
      ],
      "caption": "$\\boldsymbol u=(2,1)$、$\\boldsymbol v=(3,4)$ 从同一原点出发；$\\boldsymbol u$ 是一条斜直线，不是坐标轴。",
      "id": "stage.case.ch01.projection.definition.1",
      "layout": "overlay",
      "title": "第一步：给出方向 u 与向量 v",
      "visible_aliases": [
        "sem__case1_v",
        "sem__case1_v__end",
        "sem__case1_v__origin",
        "sem__case1_u",
        "sem__case1_u__end",
        "sem__case1_u__origin"
      ],
      "visible_refs": [
        "case1_v",
        "case1_u"
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": [
        0.0,
        2.65
      ],
      "caption": "从 $\\boldsymbol v$ 的终点向 $\\boldsymbol u$ 所在直线作垂线，垂足为 $H$；$\\overrightarrow{OH}$ 就是投影 $\\boldsymbol p=\\frac{\\boldsymbol v\\cdot\\boldsymbol u}{\\boldsymbol u\\cdot\\boldsymbol u}\\boldsymbol u=\\frac{10}{5}(2,1)=(4,2)$。",
      "id": "stage.case.ch01.projection.definition.2",
      "layout": "overlay",
      "title": "第二步：作垂线，得投影 p 与垂足 H",
      "visible_aliases": [
        "sem__case2_v",
        "sem__case2_v__end",
        "sem__case2_v__origin",
        "sem__case2_u",
        "sem__case2_u__end",
        "sem__case2_u__origin",
        "sem__case2_p",
        "sem__case2_p__end",
        "sem__case2_p__origin",
        "sem__case2_H",
        "sem__rel.case.ch01.projection.definition.2",
        "sem__rel.case.ch01.projection.definition.2.decompose"
      ],
      "visible_refs": [
        "case2_v",
        "case2_u",
        "case2_p",
        "case2_H",
        "rel.case.ch01.projection.definition.2",
        "rel.case.ch01.projection.definition.2.decompose"
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": [
        0.0,
        2.65
      ],
      "caption": "$\\boldsymbol r=\\boldsymbol v-\\boldsymbol p=(3,4)-(4,2)=(-1,2)$，$\\boldsymbol r\\cdot\\boldsymbol u=(-1)\\times2+2\\times1=0$，所以 $\\boldsymbol r\\perp\\boldsymbol u$，即 $\\boldsymbol v=\\boldsymbol p+\\boldsymbol r$。",
      "id": "stage.case.ch01.projection.definition.3",
      "layout": "overlay",
      "title": "第三步：残差 r 与 u 正交",
      "visible_aliases": [
        "sem__case3_v",
        "sem__case3_v__end",
        "sem__case3_v__origin",
        "sem__case3_u",
        "sem__case3_u__end",
        "sem__case3_u__origin",
        "sem__case3_p",
        "sem__case3_p__end",
        "sem__case3_p__origin",
        "sem__case3_r",
        "sem__case3_r__end",
        "sem__case3_r__origin",
        "sem__case3_H",
        "sem__rel.case.ch01.projection.definition.3",
        "sem__rel.case.ch01.projection.definition.3.decompose",
        "sem__rel.case.ch01.projection.definition.3.orthogonal",
        "sem__orthogonal__3"
      ],
      "visible_refs": [
        "case3_v",
